[00:30.33]1. Glorious Jehovah, almighty, eternal,
[00:38.57]Perfect in justice, in power, in love.
[00:46.89]Source of all truth and of infinite wisdom,
[00:54.89]You rule as Sov’reign in heaven above.
[01:03.84]We as your people delight in your service;
[01:11.84]Your Kingdom truth we delight to proclaim.
[01:16.84](Chorus)
[01:21.84]Being your Witnesses, great is our priv’lege.
[01:31.00]Oh, may we ever live up to our name!
[01:47.71]2. Working together in your sacred service
[01:56.05]Binds us as brothers in love and in peace.
[02:04.45]Teaching the truth and reflecting your glory
[02:12.86]Fill us with joy as your praises increase.
[02:20.86]Known by your name, O Jehovah, our Father,
[02:28.86]We have the honor to add to your fame.
[02:34.54](Chorus)
[02:40.22]Being your Witnesses, great is our priv’lege.
[02:50.22]Oh, may we ever live up to our name!